.SH "NAME"
systemd-update-utmp.service, systemd-update-utmp \- Write audit and utmp updates at bootup and shutdown
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.PP
systemd\-update\-utmp\&.service
.PP
/usr/lib/systemd/systemd\-update\-utmp
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
systemd\-update\-utmp\&.service
is a service that writes system reboots and shutdown requests to utmp and wtmp, as well as the audit logs\&.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.PP
\fBsystemd\fR(1), \fButmp\fR(5), \fBauditd\fR(8)
